# NUC-36: per-job override for agent_propose.sh (AGENT_JOB_OVERRIDES) — overnight report.
#
# EXAMPLE ONLY. The live file lives OUTSIDE git at
#   ~/.config/agent-workforce/overnight_morning_report.env  (mode 600, owned by dave)
# and is intentionally NOT committed — mirrors daily_plan.env / eod_summary.env exactly.
# Install: copy the vars below into that path, then chmod 600.
#
# Runtime is headless Claude Code on the box subscription ($0 OpenRouter spend).
# agent_propose.sh is runtime-agnostic — it just execs AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD. This job was
# the LAST one still on hermes/OpenRouter (`-p marcus` → deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash) and
# failed 2026-07-29/30/31 on HTTP 402 once the prepaid balance hit zero; migrated 07-31.
AGENT_PROFILE=claude-sonnet
# AGENT_OWNER is the PERSONA that owns this workflow in design/agents/<name>.toml.
# It keys the episodic memory store (~/.hermes/profiles/$AGENT_OWNER/memories) and is
# deliberately NOT the same field as AGENT_PROFILE, which names the RUNTIME and keys
# cost.log's profile= column. Merging them is what made this job log memory=no-store on
# every run: there is no ~/.hermes/profiles/claude-opus/. (W1, 2026-09-02.)
AGENT_OWNER=marcus
AGENT_TASK_SLUG=overnight-morning-report
# ops mode (NUC-36): lock / preflight / cost / scorecard only. No inbox worktree, no
# write-boundary, no proposal commit — this job's artifact is the report file itself.
AGENT_RUN_MODE=ops
AGENT_MAX_ATTEMPTS=2
AGENT_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=15
AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD='~/agent-workforce/bin/run_overnight_morning_report_cc.sh'
# Artifact assertion: the runtime exits 0 when a provider error becomes the agent's
# final response, so exit code alone is not evidence the report was written
# (observed 2026-07-21: HTTP 400 and an ollama empty stream both logged
# "OK: ops run completed" having produced nothing). Without this, deliver_report.sh
# re-posts the previous day's file for up to 26h and the failure stays invisible.
# -newermt "@$AGENT_RUN_STARTED_AT" ties the check to THIS run, so yesterday's
# surviving report cannot satisfy it. Single-quoted: expands at run time, not here.
AGENT_VERIFY_CMD='find "$HOME/logs/overnight" -name "morning-report-*.md" -newermt "@$AGENT_RUN_STARTED_AT" | grep -q .'
